  "title": "Vertiv Announces New Rack Cooling System for Edge IT Deployments",
  "summary": "Vertiv introduced new and upgraded thermal management products at AHR Expo today, headlined by the new Vertiv™ VRC rack cooling system, designed to fit easily into racks in small server rooms, network closets and similar edge computing environments. The Vertiv VRC can be configured and installed to meet the space restrictions of any edge site. It will be available globally in Spring of 2019.",
